# Hits: a whole literal with a star column (SELECT *, alias.*, ", *") assigned to SQL.Text /
# CommandText, added with SQL.Add, or passed to Open / ExecSQL (12-18).
# Non-hits: named columns, COUNT(*), a multiplication, MAX(*), UPDATE, DELETE, a concatenation.
sql-select-star 12
sql-select-star 13
sql-select-star 14
sql-select-star 15
sql-select-star 16
sql-select-star 17
sql-select-star 18
